### Performance Test Artifacts ###
# Generated test raw data (keep reports: BASELINE-REPORT-*.md)
performance/results/*.jtl
performance/results/*.json
performance/results/jmeter-report/
performance/results/debug-*
# Gatling build output (simulation logs, HTML reports)
performance/gatling/target/
# JMeter generated logs and debug files
performance/jmeter/debug-*.jmx
jmeter.log
# Generated test data SQL (large auto-generated files)
performance/test-data/insert-*.sql
# JVM crash and compiler replay dumps
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
# Python cache (also covered above, explicit for perf scripts)
scripts/__pycache__/
performance/**/__pycache__/
